   <section class="people-source">
    <div class="people-source__inner">
     <div class="people-source__block people-source__block--text-image">
      <div class="people-source__text">
       <h2>Learning Never Stops</h2>
       <p>From product knowledge and service excellence to tea craftsmanship and brand values, we provide structured training and learning opportunities that help our people develop professionally while embracing the standards and spirit that define KOI.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="people-source__image"><img src="/images/pages/en/images/impact_uploads/20260717125941_6a59b6bd970035.23113767.jpg" alt="">
      </div>
     </div>
     <div class="people-source__block people-source__block--image-text">
      <div class="people-source__image"><img src="/images/pages/en/images/impact_uploads/20260717125941_6a59b6bd973237.12989853.jpg" alt="">
      </div>
      <div class="people-source__text">
       <h2>A Stage for<br>
         Excellence</h2>
       <p>The Global Shaker Master Competition is more than a contest. It is a platform for learning, sharing, and growth. It encourages our people to refine their craft, challenge themselves, and strive for excellence.</p>
      </div>
     </div>
     <div class="people-source__block people-source__block--image-top">
      <div class="people-source__image"><img src="/images/pages/en/images/impact_uploads/20260720140913_6a5dbb898b04b9.35425282.jpg" alt="">
      </div>
      <div class="people-source__text">
       <h2>Stronger Together</h2>
       <p>Beyond professional development, we care deeply about the well-being and connection of our people. Through company trips, annual celebrations, team-building activities, and community initiatives, we create opportunities for meaningful connection, shared experiences, and positive impact. Together, we foster a culture where people feel valued, supported, and inspired to grow.</p>
      </div>
     </div>
    </div>
   </section>
